### Session 1 requests - run from IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code REST Client, or copy the curl lines from the README.

### Checkpoint B - simple chat
GET http://localhost:8080/chat?q=How do I reset my password?

### Checkpoint C - answer + tokens + latency
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/meta?q=Explain our SLA tiers in two sentences

### Checkpoint D - streaming (Server-Sent Events)
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/stream?q=Write a short welcome message for a new customer
Accept: text/event-stream

### Checkpoint E - which model is active?
GET http://localhost:8080/models

### Stretch - temperature 0.0 vs 1.0
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/temperature?q=Suggest a name for our support bot&t=0.0&runs=5

###
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/temperature?q=Suggest a name for our support bot&t=1.0&runs=5

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
